      "message": "sure, Mikhail.\n\nI feel that hardcoding mCallLock in the macro still has the same potential for misuse. As you know, macros offer both readability and error-proneness, but in the Audio AOSP source code, I see minimal usage of macros.\n\nPatchset 3 offers type safety with a little sacrifice in readability. Please review it.\n\nIf you still feel that hardcoding the macro is better, I will change it in the next patchset.",
